,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":31.674312886,"data":"Recommendation:\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":31.674316836,"data":"  RAW representation      -\u003e keep untouched, source for character n-gram features\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":31.674321454,"data":"                              (typo/morphology robust) and for entity/number extraction\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":31.674347174,"data":"                              that depends on original casing/punctuation.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":31.674352361,"data":"  NORMALIZED representation -\u003e NFKC unicode normalize, collapse whitespace, strip HTML/\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":31.674356646,"data":"                              URLs, strip publisher-boilerplate tokens (they are pure\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":31.674360791,"data":"                              metadata / (B) boilerplate, not (D) leakage — they appear\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":31.674366163,"data":"                              in both classes at similar rates per the structure audit\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":31.674370309,"data":"                              above, so they add noise without label signal).\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":31.674374535,"data":"  MODEL representation    -\u003e word+char TF-IDF built on the NORMALIZED text; numbers,\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":31.674378882,"data":"                              negation words and punctuation are deliberately NOT\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":31.674383783,"data":"                              stripped (see Sections 9-11) since those carry the\n"}
