,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":40.503286668,"data":"mean fraction of TITLE words that are capitalized: 84.5%\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":40.503359746,"data":"-\u003e Indonesian news headlines are largely Title-Cased, so a naive capitalized-word\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":40.503370183,"data":"   heuristic is NOT discriminative when applied to titles (nearly every word qualifies).\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":40.50337539,"data":"   We therefore extract proxy entities from CONTENT ONLY (normal sentence case)\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":40.503380524,"data":"   and measure their coverage inside the (lowercased) title text instead.\n"}
