,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":247.486558018,"data":"   conclusion: Yes\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":247.486562554,"data":"   implication: Punctuation removal not justified by evidence found.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":247.486566902,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":247.486571379,"data":"Q: Should numbers be preserved?\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":247.486576003,"data":"   evidence: Sec.11\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":247.486579958,"data":"   conclusion: Yes\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":247.48658384,"data":"   implication: Numbers carry factual-consistency signal.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":247.486587756,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":247.486591507,"data":"Q: Should title/content be vectorized separately?\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":247.486595389,"data":"   evidence: Framing in Sec.0 + Sec.4-6 structural differences\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":247.486599326,"data":"   conclusion: Yes\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":247.486603395,"data":"   implication: Never concatenate title+content into one field.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":247.486607406,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":247.486611069,"data":"Q: Should character n-grams be used?\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":247.486614899,"data":"   evidence: Sec.8/10 morphology + typo robustness\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":247.486618952,"data":"   conclusion: Yes\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":247.486622838,"data":"   implication: Pairs well with linear classifiers per literature.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":247.486627013,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":247.486632715,"data":"Q: Is train/test leakage present?\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":247.486640236,"data":"   evidence: Sec.21 overlap=1348/3603 rows\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":247.486657661,"data":"   conclusion: Non-trivial\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":247.486662453,"data":"   implication: Adjust trust in leaderboard score accordingly.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":247.486667405,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":247.486671905,"data":"Q: Should validation be grouped?\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":247.486676525,"data":"   evidence: Sec.29 simulated contamination\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":247.48668051800001,"data":"   conclusion: Yes\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":247.486684301,"data":"   implication: StratifiedGroupKFold on content_hash.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":247.486688215,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":247.486692033,"data":"Q: Is a lightweight linear model plausible?\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":247.486695937,"data":"   evidence: Sec.27 diagnostic classifier F1s\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":247.486704465,"data":"   conclusion: Yes, as a strong baseline\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":247.48670842,"data":"   implication: TF-IDF + LinearSVC is a reasonable first full model.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":247.486712327,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":247.486716006,"data":"Q: Is semantic embedding likely necessary?\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":247.486719859,"data":"   evidence: Sec.14/27 lexical-only ceiling\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":247.486723727,"data":"   conclusion: Only if lexical baseline underperforms\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":247.486727707,"data":"   implication: Gate behind a Macro F1 threshold (e.g. \u003c0.90) before investing.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":247.486734399,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":247.486742515,"data":"Q: Cheapest next experiment with highest expected information gain?\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":247.486760788,"data":"   evidence: Synthesis of all sections above\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":247.486765313,"data":"   conclusion: Word+char TF-IDF + handcrafted relationship features + LinearSVC, grouped CV\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":247.486770852,"data":"   implication: See Section 31 roadmap.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":247.486775633,"data":"\n"}
